rem Totient Maximum
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=69
rem Find n up to a limit that maximises
rem n / phi(n)

use sequences
use io
use cli

option Limit integer = 1000000

rem n / phi(n) = product of p / (p - 1)
rem over primes p of n. More primes win,
rem so take the largest primorial.
Prods = primes scan * with 1
Answer = Prods till greater Limit last
Answer print
